idea-plugin.description:
Adds an editor action that copies the current selection with a header line
containing the absolute file path and the line range, e.g.
<pre>
// /Users/you/project/src/main.cpp:42-50
int solve(int n) {
    ...
}
</pre>
Useful for pasting code into AI chats (Claude, ChatGPT) together with its
exact location so the assistant knows which file and lines you mean.
